Each fragment reveals a memory. However, the memories do not always agree with one another. As the player progresses, the environment changes, familiar places become unfamiliar, and the player begins questioning their identity and the reliability of their own memories.
The central themes are forgotten identity, reincarnation, distorted memories, guilt, repetition, and the fear of discovering the truth.
