The Husk System (Signature Mechanic)
Death Freeze & Silhouette: Upon dying, the game briefly freezes with the message "YOU HAVE LEFT SOMETHING BEHIND". A dark silhouette of the player character is forged at the exact coordinates of death.
Physical Utility: Husks are solid on top and can be used as stepping stones to reach high ledges (e.g., climbing out of the Room 1 troll pit), placed on pressure plates to hold open gates, or pushed.
Husk Evolution:
Remnants: Static physical bodies used as platforms.
Echoes: Replay short jumping or falling death loops.
Shadows: Autonomous Husks in Room 4 that replay recorded sequences to step on remote switches for the player.
