Pre-Game Consent: Transparency screen explaining local in-game behavioral tracking with a clean "Reset House Memory" option.
Telemetry Tracking: Silently monitors direction bias (Left vs. Right choices), jump frequency, platform hesitation, Ghost compliance, retry cadence, and secret nook exploration.
Tendency Diagnosis: Analyzes whether the player is THE SPRINTER, THE EXPLORER, THE TESTER, THE FOLLOWER, THE DEFIER, THE REPEATER, or THE OBSERVER.
Dynamic House Read Badge: Minimalist top-right telemetry indicator (CALM, OBSERVING, PREDICTING, UNPREDICTABLE).
Poker Face Mechanic (Shift)
Holding Shift activates a shimmering violet distortion field that temporarily masks the player's behavioral signals from the House's predictive algorithms.
Consumes energy (recharges over time).
Allows dodging predicted ceiling crushers and prompts the Devil to pause: "...Interesting."
