Room II (The Ghost): Introduces the Ghost with a discoverable visual cue: Blue flicker = Truthful advice; Red flicker = Deceptive / troll advice.
Room III (The House Remembers): The layout and in-world text adapt to whether the player habitually goes Left or Right ("YOU ALWAYS CHOOSE LEFT").
Room IV (The Shadow): A living Shadow Husk steps onto a remote pressure plate to hold open a heavy barrier for the player.
Room V (The Archive of Guilt): Reconstructed memory room containing the 4 creator transcripts ("You built this place", "You wanted them to keep playing", "You called it an experiment", "You promised nobody would get hurt").
